# A missing build file (an old tab asking for last deploy's hashed JS, worker
# or wasm) must be a real 404, not index.html with a 200: that HTML would be
# cached as the asset and break scanning until a reload. Non-forced, so files
# that exist are served as normal. Must come before the SPA fallback.
/assets/*  /404.html  404
/* /index.html 200
